{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "ea3ce7c52d76ca8408dbec48965d3d8d7b713de7b7d4cb75d74f4f3724cf4a5c", "ja": "あわあわ、ぶくぶく、あぶくぶく～♪\n撮影楽しかったですね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "泡泡，啵啵啵，啊啵啵啵～♪\n拍照很有趣呢，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4f62043cb1aae246760e0ceaf213df213550de585e6a7c0358a0d5ae70a20480", "ja": "うん。撮影クルーが、いい画が撮れたって言ってたよ。\n何故か俺まで、泡だらけにされたけど……。", "zh": "嗯，摄影团队也说拍到了好照片喔。\n虽然连我也莫名其妙沾了满身泡泡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "d32e6446f7a358182d5136fa9f0f8725e09be98f65e3ea35fad114e1f1437d48", "ja": "ふふっ。鼻にちょこんと泡をのっけた\n{$P$}さん、キュートでしたよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，鼻子上沾着一点泡泡的\n{$P$}先生，很可爱喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d629d3ece3f428b65da520e5f8d82ab82a8af67c57112d983b567f59c375929f", "ja": "シャワーを浴びせられて、全身ずぶ濡れにもなったな。", "zh": "而且我还被冲了一身水，整个人都湿透了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "2f9f4f93e9025505e5fc8c70a315bec5391b921fa2eaafe1f82e1bcc21893745", "ja": "水もしたたる普通の男って感じで、\n私、キュンキュンしました♪", "zh": "这就是所谓帅到滴水的平凡男子，\n让我怦然心动啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ce07358e21224ceea79cf186f579051907798f32b986cb7bcc5e1a828c44528c", "ja": "まあ、撮影は上手くいったしな……うん。\n麗花も楽しかったみたいだし。", "zh": "算了，反正拍照很顺利……嗯。\n再说丽花好像也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "56120a4c2e85781f6f8ae111051bdd9d98fa19570fb8f363b1c55ba1666db72d", "ja": "はい♪　{$P$}さんのおかげで、\n私、お仕事とっても楽しいです♪", "zh": "是啊♪多亏有{$P$}先生，\n我觉得工作真的非常有趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "2324335ab3f4ade89170268301002bab5e72e396c6fc7edc1343966cfcb5ba75", "ja": "今日の撮影も、こう、胸がぎゅーっと\nしめつけられる感じで、私、私……。", "zh": "今天拍摄时也有种胸口一紧的感觉，\n我、我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e6b9b5e6a554537d580e1ee99d4db1004d6c808a7d5e3bdee3d201a5f9ced696", "ja": "麗花？", "zh": "丽花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "3cb7ee02f9fa7ab2143ce563a038c200ee7637e8221c5efe12aab68fb49d9b59", "ja": "うーん、いっぱい体を動かしたからでしょうか？\nなんだか、眠くなってきちゃいました……。", "zh": "嗯～是因为一直在活动身体的缘故吗？\n我开始想睡觉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "209f2eff60632a94786f0665188c40874c2d5d2261ea648f903b9e6ed1673a9b", "ja": "こ、こら、麗花！\n寝るなら、家に帰ってからにしてくれ！", "zh": "啊、喂，丽花！\n要睡的话拜托回家再睡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "bbe5fba22cc185d85441f591a8e12d103fdca5abb4b752ed68b80e780458b078", "ja": "そうですね……\n寝るなら、服も脱がなくちゃ、ですね……。", "zh": "对喔……\n要睡的话，也得把衣服脱下来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0023_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cda0d669e9d779283848e6e5c4c033d78f0282cd57820105bb9dd60d083019a1", "ja": "脱ぐのも、自分の部屋で！　今日はもう帰って\nいいから……ほら、家まで送るから起きろ！", "zh": "脱衣服也回自己房间脱！你今天已经可以回家了……\n来，我送你回去，所以快醒来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
